# Settings

Put every new user setting on `settingsPage` in `Duper.lua`, and persist it in `saveConfig` and `applySavedConfig`.

Keep the UI to a label and a control. No hint text, captions, or explanations of where something saves or how to use it.

```lua
-- BAD
Text = "Click the key, then press a new one."

-- GOOD
Text = "Toggle key"
```
